## API reference

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `Toolbar` | `orientation:` (`:horizontal`), `loop_focus:` (`true`), `disabled:` | The `role="toolbar"` strip. |
| `ToolbarButton` | `disabled:`; block `{ \|item\| … }` | A button item (a plain `<button>` without a block argument). |
| `ToolbarLink` | `href:`; block `{ \|item\| … }` | A link item. |
| `ToolbarInput` | `disabled:`; block `{ \|item\| … }` | An input item - ←/→ leave it only at the text's edges. |
| `ToolbarGroup` | `disabled:`, `aria_label:` | A `role="group"` of items. |
| `ToolbarSeparator` | `orientation:` | A divider across the toolbar's axis. |

## Accessibility

- `role="toolbar"`, one tab stop; ←/→ (or ↑/↓ when vertical) move focus, Home / End jump to the ends.
- Disabled items stay reachable (`aria-disabled`) so keyboard users can still read them.
- Name the toolbar and each group with `aria_label:`.
